%%% note
http:request の proxy: proxy-config の 2 つの書き方、利用者と合言葉、nonProxyHosts の照合の規則 (h<N>: nonProxyHosts と宛先の組)
%%% port 18410
%%% request GET /via-a
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "method": "GET",
  "requestUri": "/a/b?q=1",
  "host": "target.example:8080",
  "proxyAuth": null,
  "via": "proxy"
}
%%% request POST /via-b
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "method": "POST",
  "requestUri": "/c",
  "host": "target.example:8080",
  "proxyAuth": "Basic dTpw",
  "via": "proxy"
}
%%% request GET /bypass
%%% response 200
content-type: application/octet-stream; charset=UTF-8

direct
%%% request GET /h1
%%% response 200
content-type: application/json; charset=UTF-8

{
  "method": "GET",
  "requestUri": "/direct",
  "host": "foo.example.com:18410",
  "proxyAuth": null,
  "via": "proxy"
}
